    <div class="q"><span class="n">8</span><span>Use the portable careful time-cleft link: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="It was Tuesday that we met" data-hint="Focus Tuesday and link the remaining clause with that." data-fix="It was Tuesday that we met.">choose</button>.</span></div>
