      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="What resolved the mismatch was the updated transaction log." data-hint="The what-clause frames the open cause; the singular log supplies its value." data-fix="What resolved the mismatch was the updated transaction log."><p class="quiz-question">3. Which pseudo-cleft frames the cause and then identifies it?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="What resolved the mismatch was the updated transaction log.">What resolved the mismatch was the updated transaction log.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="What it resolved the mismatch was log updated.">What it resolved the mismatch was log updated.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="It what was mismatch resolved log.">It what was mismatch resolved log.</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="All the board authorized was a three-month extension." data-hint="All limits the documented action and blocks a permanent-approval claim." data-fix="All the board authorized was a three-month extension."><p class="quiz-question">4. Which line preserves the limited scope?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="All the board authorized was a three-month extension.">All the board authorized was a three-month extension.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="All means the board authorized every future extension permanently.">All means the board authorized every future extension permanently.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="What all board was authorize extension.">What all board was authorize extension.</button></div></div>
